<section id="the-gap" class="problem page-section" data-section="the-gap"><div class="section-label">02 / The Gap</div><div class="manifesto"><h2>The hardest part is often knowing what to ask.</h2><p class="gap-body">Most students nearing graduation know they want a next step. Fewer know what to ask for, or who to ask. Informal networks are uneven. Waypoint gives eligible students a structured way to say what they need, and a person who reviews who might help.</p><aside><p><b>01</b> Unclear direction</p><p><b>02</b> Uneven access to people with relevant experience</p><p><b>03</b> Matching done by hand, inconsistently</p></aside></div></section>
