<section id="faq" class="faq page-section" data-section="faq"><div><div class="section-label">08 / Questions, answered</div><h2>Good to know.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary class="faq-normal">Do mentors have to accept? <span>⌄</span></summary><p>No. Mentors volunteer on their terms and can accept or decline each proposal.</p></details><details><summary class="faq-normal">Can I change my request? <span>⌄</span></summary><p>Yes, you can edit a structured request before a match is approved.</p></details><details><summary class="faq-editorial">What happens to conversation content? <span>⌄</span></summary><p>Waypoint records relationship status and feedback, never private messages or meeting content.</p></details></div></section>
